# ==========================================================================
# PAYSTACK — template. Copy to .env.local and fill THAT in. No real values here.
#
# THIS FILE IS GITIGNORED AND MUST STAY THAT WAY. Confirm any time with:
#     git check-ignore -v .env.local
#
# Keys: https://dashboard.paystack.com/#/settings/developers
#
#   pk_…   PUBLIC key.  Safe in the browser. It can only start a payment.
#   sk_…   SECRET key.  NEVER in the browser, never in git, never pasted into
#          a chat or a screenshot. Whoever holds sk_live_ can charge cards,
#          issue refunds, and export your entire customer list.
#          If one ever leaks, roll it in the dashboard immediately — rolling
#          kills the old key on the spot.
#
# THERE IS NO test/live SWITCH. It is whichever pair of keys the environment
# holds. Test keys here on your laptop; on Vercel you set test values for
# Preview/Development and live values for Production. One less setting that
# can disagree with itself.
#
# Test cards: https://paystack.com/docs/payments/test-payments
# ==========================================================================

PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=

# Tuition in KOBO — naira times 100, a whole number.
#   ₦500,000  ->  50000000
#
# LEFT EMPTY ON PURPOSE. content.md still reads "[TO CONFIRM — tuition,
# deposit, payment plan]" and this repo's rule is never to invent a price.
# While it is empty the pay section shows no figure, the button is disabled,
# and /api/paystack/init refuses to charge rather than guessing. Fill it in
# when the number is decided.
PAYSTACK_AMOUNT_KOBO=
PAYSTACK_CURRENCY=NGN
